flowchart TB
    OP["A process opens<br/>/tmp/perms/listable/data.txt"]

    OP --> D1{"Traverse /tmp?<br/>needs x on the directory"}
    D1 -->|no| DENY1["EACCES<br/><i>error names the file</i>"]
    D1 -->|yes| D2{"Traverse perms?<br/>needs x"}
    D2 -->|no| DENY1
    D2 -->|yes| D3{"Traverse listable?<br/>needs x — mode is 644,<br/>so there is no x"}
    D3 -->|no| DENY1
    D3 -->|yes| D4{"Read data.txt?<br/>needs r — mode is 644,<br/>so yes"}
    D4 -->|yes| OK["Contents returned"]

    DENY1 --> NOTE["The file was readable all along.<br/>Every directory on the path is<br/>part of the decision, and the<br/>error names only the last object."]

    CLS["Bits are read by the FIRST<br/>matching class, not the union:<br/>owner, then group, then other.<br/><br/>A file you own with mode 077<br/>is unreadable to you and<br/>readable to everyone else."]
    D4 -.-> CLS
